title: Finances & Fundraising.
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs
go-to: menu

@menu

= Finances

We can control our finances and funds of our party here.

- @workers
- @new_middle
- @old_middle
- @rural
- @unemployed
- @easy_discard

@workers
subtitle: Current dues: [+ workers_dues +] / 5

= Workers

How should we treat workers?

- @increase_dues_w: Increase dues of workers
- @decrease_dues_w: Decrease dues of workers
- @menu: Back

@increase_dues_w
choose-if: workers_dues < 5
on-arrival: workers_dues += 1; workers_spd -= 1 * workers_dues; left_dissent += 2 * workers_dues; labor_dissent += 2 * workers_dues

We have increased dues of workers to [+ workers_dues +]. Workers are unhappy about this.

@decrease_dues_w
choose-if: workers_dues > 0
on-arrival: workers_dues -= 1; workers_spd += 2; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent -= 2; labor_dissent -= 4; reformist_dissent -= 2

We have decreased dues of workers to [+ workers_dues +]. Nobody is gonna reward us for it, however our grassroot members are energized.

@new_middle
subtitle: Current dues: [+ new_middle_dues +] / 5

= New Middle Class

How should we treat the new middle class?

- @increase_dues_nm: Increase dues of new middle class
- @decrease_dues_nm: Decrease dues of new middle class
- @menu: Back

@increase_dues_nm
choose-if: new_middle_dues < 5
on-arrival: new_middle_dues += 1; new_middle_spd -= 2 * new_middle_dues; center_dissent += 2 * new_middle_dues; reformist_dissent += 2 * new_middle_dues

We have increased dues of the new middle class to [+ new_middle_dues +]. As the non socialist class, it causes defections amongst their rows.

@decrease_dues_nm
choose-if: new_middle_dues > 0
on-arrival: new_middle_dues -= 1; new_middle_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 5; left_dissent -= 2; reformist_dissent -= 4; labor_dissent -= 2

We have decreased dues of the new middle class to [+ new_middle_dues +].

@old_middle
subtitle: Current dues: [+ old_middle_dues +] / 5

= Old Middle Class

How should we treat the old middle class?

- @increase_dues_om: Increase dues of old middle class
- @decrease_dues_om: Decrease dues of old middle class
- @menu: Back

@increase_dues_om
choose-if: old_middle_dues < 5
on-arrival: old_middle_dues += 1; old_middle_spd -= 1 * old_middle_dues; center_dissent += 2 * old_middle_dues

We have increased dues of the old middle class to [+ old_middle_dues +]. The old middle class is unhappy about this, already being most conservative class.

@decrease_dues_om
choose-if: old_middle_dues > 0
on-arrival: old_middle_dues -= 1; old_middle_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 4

We have decreased dues of the old middle class to [+ old_middle_dues +].

@rural
subtitle: Current dues: [+ rural_dues +] / 5

= Rural

How should we treat the rural population?

- @increase_dues_r: Increase dues of rural population
- @decrease_dues_r: Decrease dues of rural population
- @menu: Back

@increase_dues_r
choose-if: rural_dues < 5
on-arrival: rural_dues += 1; rural_spd -= 1 * rural_dues

We have increased dues of the rural population to [+ rural_dues +]. The rural members are unhappy about this and are defecting to Landvolks.

@decrease_dues_r
choose-if: rural_dues > 0
on-arrival: rural_dues -= 1; rural_spd += 2; center_dissent -= 2

We have decreased dues of the rural population to [+ rural_dues +].

@unemployed
subtitle: Current dues: [+ unemployed_dues +] / 5

= Unemployed

How should we treat the unemployed?

- @increase_dues_u: Increase dues of the unemployed
- @decrease_dues_u: Decrease dues of the unemployed
- @menu: Back

@increase_dues_u
choose-if: unemployed_dues < 5
on-arrival: unemployed_dues += 1; unemployed_spd -= 3 * unemployed_dues; left_dissent += 2 * unemployed_dues

We have increased dues of the unemployed to [+ unemployed_dues +]. Already unemployed, they are much susceptible to the dues increases.

@decrease_dues_u
choose-if: unemployed_dues > 0
on-arrival: unemployed_dues -= 1; unemployed_spd += 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 2; center_dissent -= 2

We have decreased dues of the unemployed to [+ unemployed_dues +]. We benefit the most from lowest dues for unemployed members due to their vulnerable status.
